%F A364623 a(n) = Sum_{k=0..n} binomial(n+5*k+2,6*k+2) * binomial(3*k,k) / (2*k+1).
%F A364623 D-finite with recurrence 2*n*(2*n+1)*a(n) +3*(-13*n^2+3*n+2)*a(n-1) +3*(-43*n^2+255*n-282)*a(n-2) +3*(193*n^2-1187*n+1780)*a(n-3) +15*(-65*n^2+483*n-888)*a(n-4) +84*(7*n-30)*(2*n-9)*a(n-5) -168*(3*n-14)*(2*n-11)*a(n-6) +24*(11*n-56)*(2*n-13)*a(n-7) -6*(13*n-72)*(2*n-15)*a(n-8) +10*(n-6)*(2*n-17)*a(n-9)=0. - _R. J. Mathar_, Nov 02 2026
%o A364623 (PARI) a(n) = sum(k=0, n, binomial(n+5*k+2, 6*k+2)*binomial(3*k, k)/(2*k+1));
